# Narrow by intent (audit 2026-08-06): .sh must be LF on every host -- stock
# bash on macOS/Linux fails on CRLF scripts, and Windows Git Bash accepts LF.
# NO blanket `* text=auto` here: .md/.ps1/.json conventions are governed by the
# installer's EOL policy (InstallJournal.ps1) and consumer depot conventions;
# renormalizing them package-wide would churn every clone.
*.sh text eol=lf
